      },
      {
        "text": "Characters:\nMira Fenlow: woman, 26, bookkeeper auditing House Varlen; sturdy, chipped front tooth, brown hair in a slipping knot; taps a pencil against her teeth\nJosselin Varlen: man, 29, head of House Varlen; tall and long-limbed, crooked nose, coats short in the sleeve; fidgets with his cuffs\nHollis Bray: man, 61, steward of House Varlen; grey and unhurried, a ring of every key in the house; tells stories about the house\nPerrin Ashgrove: man, 44, owner of Aldwick's second-largest warehouse; neat, well-dressed, easy smile; compliments first, point second",
        "contextConfig": {
