      {
        "text": "Story So Far\nType: memory\nEarlier:\n- Last week Hollis Bray hired Mira to audit the books, because something in them felt wrong to him; Josselin was not asked.\n- This month Perrin Ashgrove began asking House Varlen's client families whether they are happy with their service.\nUpcoming (not happened yet):\n- In three weeks the trade council meets to renew the river warehouse contracts.",
