        "text": "House Varlen\nType: location\nDescription: Aldwick's wealthiest merchant house, grand and slightly threadbare: good rugs over cold floors, a counting room smelling of dust and lamp oil, a portrait gallery with one empty hook.\nPurpose: holds the river warehouse contracts every other trader depends on",
